# goals.config -- dso-iac-scan
#
# Moi Nhiem vu (1..4) trong de co it nhat 1 goal do duoc. Ty le bao mat/
# hardening: fix_network_storage va fix_secret_iam la 2 goal hardening
# tinh chinh (siet Security Group + S3, loai secret hardcode + IAM
# least-privilege), pass_gate chi PASS khi hardening da hoan tat VA duoc
# mot dich vu doc lap (container `ci`, khong co shell) xac nhan.
#
# Tat ca cac gia tri "answer=OK" duoc TAO BOI instr_config/pregrade.sh sau
# khi tu phan tich lai ma nguon Terraform thu duoc -- sinh vien khong the
# echo gia cac file .local/result/chk_* vi chung bi pregrade.sh ghi de moi
# lan cham diem.

#DOC: Nhiem vu 1 - baseline_scan: da chay quet IaC va lap duoc baseline (co finding HIGH/CRITICAL) truoc khi sua.
baseline_scan = matchany : string_equal : chk_baseline : answer=OK
#SUM: ~/baseline.json ton tai, chua >=1 finding muc HIGH/CRITICAL, va lich su lenh cho thay da chay cong cu quet (tfsec/checkov/trivy).

#DOC: Nhiem vu 2 - fix_network_storage (HARDENING): Security Group va S3 bucket da duoc khac phuc.
fix_network_storage = matchany : string_equal : chk_network_storage : answer=OK
#SUM: network.tf khong con ingress 0.0.0.0/0; storage.tf da chan public access (4 co = true), bat ma hoa at-rest, bat versioning.

#DOC: Nhiem vu 3 - fix_secret_iam (HARDENING): secret hardcode da bi loai bo, IAM policy da ap dung least-privilege.
fix_secret_iam = matchany : string_equal : chk_secret_iam : answer=OK
#SUM: variables.tf khong con gia tri secret goc, cac bien nhay cam duoc danh dau sensitive = true; iam.tf khong con Action:"*"/Resource:"*".

#DOC: Nhiem vu 4 - pass_gate: da bat logging, quet lai dat 0 HIGH/CRITICAL, va vuot duoc quality gate CI de lay flag.
_after_zero_ok = matchany : string_equal : chk_after_zero : answer=OK
_logging_ok    = matchany : string_equal : chk_logging : answer=OK
_flag_ok       = matchany : string_equal : flag_submitted : parameter.iacflag
pass_gate      = boolean : (_after_zero_ok and _logging_ok and _flag_ok)
#SUM: Ma Terraform hien tai sach HIGH/CRITICAL (kiem tra lai doc lap), logging.tf da bat cau hinh flow log + S3 access log, va ~/flag.txt khop dung flag do dich vu `ci` cap (chi cap khi tu quet dat 0 HIGH/CRITICAL).
